  "ref": "JDG.11.12",
  "review_notes": [
    "`מַה־לִּי וָלָךְ` is reordered wholesale by the ASV: the second `לְ` carries the possessive *hast ... to do* under rule 43 with its suffix as subject, and the first `לְ` with its suffix supplies *with me*. The alternative was to fuse the whole idiom as noncompositional."
  ]
